   server endpoints `GET /api/tts/voices` and `POST /api/tts`. **macOS `say` output
   is converted to WAV via `afconvert`** for Chrome browser compatibility (AIFF was
   producing duration=null in Chrome). Speaker icon button injected into both
   `chat-panel.js::_appendBubble` (legacy renderer) and
   `index-v3.html::renderScratchpadEntry` (V3 scratchpad renderer). Pulsing
   loading state + accent-tinted playing state. Verified browser-side: 2.16s WAV
   parses with valid duration.

8. **Visual tab OpenRouter image/video routing.** New integration module
   `~/ora/orchestrator/integrations/openrouter_images.py` registers each OpenRouter
   image model as its own provider on `image_generates` (20 providers),
   `image_generates_cartoon` (slot inheritance), `image_styles` (3-block multi-image
   payload — source + style reference), and `image_varies` (2-block — source +
   prompt). Each video model registered on `video_generates` (13 providers) with full
   async-polling implementation (`POST /v1/videos` → polling URL → `unsigned_urls`).
   Returns raw bytes matching the openai/gemini/civitai contract. Errors raise
   `CapabilityError` with `prompt_rejected` / `quota_exceeded` / `model_unavailable`
