   - Image generation: 990 KB PNG from Gemini 2.5 Flash Image, 6 sec.
   - Image styles: 1.4 MB PNG from Gemini with source + style refs.
   - Image varies: 920 KB PNG from Gemini with source only.
   - Video generation: 5.9 MB MP4 from Google Veo 3.1 Fast, 77 sec.
   - Audio understanding: real audiobook clip transcribed accurately by GPT
     Audio Mini.

